                "accordion_row_Yh4HC4": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Warranty & Care",
                    "behavior": "drawer",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "drawer_background_color": "#ffffff",
                    "icon": "none",
                    "svg_code": "",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_zCnVJB": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Every Heitz light is made to bring lasting warmth and balance into your home. For your peace of mind, all products include a <strong>1-year warranty</strong> against manufacturing defects.</p><p>To maintain its timeless look, simply clean with a soft, dry cloth and avoid harsh chemicals. Thoughtful care helps your piece stay beautiful for years to come. For full details on what's covered and how to make a claim, visit our <a href=\"https://heitz.shop/pages/warranty\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://heitz.shop/pages/warranty\"><strong>1-Year Warranty page.</strong></a></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_zCnVJB"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_HEm7mc": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Shipping & Delivery",
                    "behavior": "drawer",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "drawer_background_color": "#ffffff",
                    "icon": "none",
                    "svg_code": "",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_TmVjRg": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We offer free, reliable shipping to the <strong>United States</strong> and the <strong>United Kingdom</strong>, so your HEITZ pieces can arrive safely and with ease.</p><p><strong>USA:</strong> Delivered in 8–15 business days<br/><strong>UK:</strong> Delivered in 5–10 business days</p><p>Every order includes full tracking. Once your order has been shipped, you’ll receive your tracking number by email, allowing you to follow your delivery every step of the way.</p><p>For more details, please read our <a href=\"https://heitz.shop/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://heitz.shop/policies/shipping-policy\"><strong>Shipping Policy</strong>.</a></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_TmVjRg"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_row_Q3FahK": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns & Refunds",
                    "behavior": "drawer",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "drawer_background_color": "#ffffff",
                    "icon": "none",
                    "svg_code": "",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_KBJhBw": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We want every HEITZ piece to feel right in your home. If you’re not completely satisfied, we offer a <strong>30-day return policy</strong> to keep the process simple and stress-free.</p><p>If your order isn’t the perfect fit, simply contact us and our support team will guide you through the return process with care.</p><p>For more information, please read our <a href=\"https://heitz.shop/policies/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://heitz.shop/policies/refund-policy\"><strong>Returns & Refunds Policy</strong>.</a></p><h3>Need Help?</h3><p>Have a question about your order, delivery, or return?<br/><br/>Email us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@heitz.shop\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@heitz.shop\"><strong>support@heitz.shop</strong></a> -we’re always happy to help.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
