                  "blocks": {
                    "text_Qnryrf": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Yes. If you have a specific lighting requirement, room size, placement idea, or need help choosing the right size, our 24/7 support team is happy to guide you.<br/><br/>Simply share your space details, preferred lighting mood, and installation plan, and we’ll help bring your vision to life with personalised recommendations.<br/><br/>Contact us anytime at: <a href=\"mailto:support@heitz.shop\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@heitz.shop\">support@heitz.shop</a></p>",
