          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_z6aQfN": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_dash_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "1. What is the brand all about?",
                "behavior": "drawer",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "drawer_background_color": "#ffffff",
                "icon": "none",
                "svg_code": "",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_aKRQ8f": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Heitz is a design-led lighting brand built on one simple belief: light should do more than brighten a room — it should bring warmth, balance, and calm into everyday spaces. Inspired by Scandinavian simplicity and Japandi balance, we curate every piece against the same standard — clean form, honest materials, and a soft, considered glow — choosing only lighting we'd happily live with ourselves.</p><p>We'd rather offer one light that's right than ten that are loud — pieces that feel timeless, intentional, and at home for years to come. <a href=\"https://heitz.shop/pages/brand-story\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Brand Story\">Discover our full story.</a></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_aKRQ8f"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_W9DNBh": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_dash_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "2. Where are you based?",
                "behavior": "drawer",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "drawer_background_color": "#ffffff",
                "icon": "none",
                "svg_code": "",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_igVQeU": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We are based in the <strong>United States</strong> and currently serve customers across the <strong>USA and UK</strong>. As we continue to grow, we’re looking forward to expanding into more regions soon.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
